## 2. Environment & Role Enrollment Configuration

### Step 1: Configure `.env`
Create a `.env` file in the repository root (`consensus-guard/.env`) based on `.env.example`:

```env
# Upstream Eidos / Detectif Biometric API
DETECTIF_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
EIDOS_BASE_URL=[https://api.detectif.ai](https://api.detectif.ai)

# Executive Role -> Enrolled Speaker ID Mapping
EIDOS_CFO_SPEAKER_ID=cfo
EIDOS_COO_SPEAKER_ID=coo
EIDOS_VP_SPEAKER_ID=vp
EIDOS_HOL_SPEAKER_ID=hol

# Backend Server Settings
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
